<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεσθίω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέδομαι</span>: pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεδήδοκα</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέφαγον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eat away, eat up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέδεταί σου τοὔψον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1032
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epimenid.
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν πόλεων τὸ σκῖρον ἐξεδήδοκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					925
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν μή σ᾽ ἐκφάγω ἐκ τῆσδε τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					698
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεσθίουσι αὐτὰ</span> (the
			grubs) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μέλιτται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					554b4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.150
			</span></i>.</div>
